    summary_en: "Pet supply retailer Wanda Pet (6968) issued a major announcement on July 27, revealing that its partner vendor's information system was infiltrated by unknown individuals, potentially resulting in a partial data leak. The company has required the partner vendor to immediately conduct a comprehensive cybersecurity audit and vulnerability patching, stating that this incident will not significantly impact Wanda Pet's finances or daily operations. Addressing public concerns regarding member data security, Wanda Pet specifically clarified that its system is not connected to the partner vendor's system for any member credit card numbers, bank accounts, or any financial transaction sensitive information. Therefore, the company guarantees that this incident will not affect the security of financial transactions, nor will it pose a risk of member payment information leakage.",
