    title: "Instapaper 10 重大更新：為 iOS 帶來 Liquid Glass 小工具、新字體與多任務改善",
    summary: "Instapaper 今日發布了其 iPhone 和 iPad 應用程式的第 10 版，並同步進行了網站平台的重大重新設計。本次更新被描述為十多年來最大的升級。對於 iOS 用戶，主要新增了支援 Liquid Glass 的主畫面小工具，可顯示當前文章和最近儲存的項目，並作為一鍵閱讀快捷方式。此外，應用程式增加了四種閱讀字體：Literata、New York、Open Sans 和 Atkinson Hyperlegible。iPad 用戶受益於多任務處理的改善，而所有用戶都能享受到更可靠的背景同步、縮短的文章下載時間，以及重新設計的入門流程。此外，應用程式還增加了區段計數和更靈活的排序功能，並在文章列表增加了「精簡檢視」選項，讓用戶可以調整樣式和字體。對於 Android 平台，則新增了 AI 語音支援。網站平台也進行了全面改版，加入了三欄閱讀器和鍵盤快捷鍵。",
    tags: ["Instapaper", "iOS", "iPadOS", "Liquid Glass", "字體", "應用程式更新"],
    title_en: "Instapaper 10 Major Update: Bringing Liquid Glass Widgets, New Fonts, and Multitasking Improvements to iOS",
    summary_en: "Instapaper today released version 10 of its iPhone and iPad applications, alongside a major redesign of its web platform. This update is described as the biggest upgrade in over a decade. For iOS users, the main addition is support for Liquid Glass home screen widgets, which can display the current article and recently saved items, serving as a one-tap reading shortcut. Additionally, the application has added four reading fonts: Literata, New York, Open Sans, and Atkinson Hyperlegible. iPad users benefit from improved multitasking capabilities, while all users can enjoy more reliable background syncing, faster article download times, and a redesigned onboarding flow. Furthermore, the application includes section counters and more flexible sorting options, and an article list now features a \"Simplified View\" option, allowing users to adjust styles and fonts. For the Android platform, AI voice support has been added. The web platform has also undergone a complete overhaul, incorporating a three-column reader and keyboard shortcuts.",
    tags_en: ["Instapaper", "iOS", "iPadOS", "Liquid Glass", "Fonts", "App Update"],
