    category: "前瞻技術",
    title: "前資工大行CISO Blauner談資安領導力演變：強調韌性與共同防禦",
    summary: "本文為 Dark Reading 的系列訪談，邀請前花旗銀行 CISO Charles Blauner 分享其在資安領域的經驗。Blauner 談到 CISO 職位從技術職位轉變為戰略領導職位，並指出現代資安領導者必須具備超越技術的韌性、溝通能力和商業敏銳度。他強調資安的成功取決於持續領先於不斷演進的威脅，這使得 CISO 角色極具挑戰性。Blauner 認為，資安的未來重點不只是保護技術，更要幫助組織建立持久的營運韌性。他還提到，建立資安社群和共同防禦（Collective Defense）至關重要，並強調了回饋和指導（Mentoring）的文化。修補建議方面，文章未提供具體技術修補，但建議企業應將營運韌性納入核心戰略考量。",
    tags: ["CISO", "Charles Blauner", "營運韌性", "資安領導力", "共同防禦", "資安戰略"],
    title_en: "Former Citi CISO Blauner Discusses the Evolution of Cybersecurity Leadership: Emphasizing Resilience and Collective Defense",
    summary_en: "This article is part of Dark Reading's interview series, featuring former Citibank CISO Charles Blauner sharing his experience in the cybersecurity field. Blauner discusses how the CISO role has transitioned from a technical function to a strategic leadership position, noting that modern cybersecurity leaders must possess resilience, communication skills, and business acumen that go beyond technical expertise. He emphasizes that cybersecurity success depends on continuously staying ahead of evolving threats, making the CISO role highly challenging. Blauner believes that the future focus of cybersecurity is not just protecting technology, but helping organizations build lasting operational resilience. He also highlighted the importance of building a cybersecurity community and collective defense, and stressed the culture of mentoring and feedback. Regarding remediation advice, the article does not provide specific technical patches, but recommends that enterprises incorporate operational resilience into their core strategic considerations.",
    tags_en: ["CISO", "Charles Blauner", "Operational Resilience", "Cybersecurity Leadership", "Collective Defense", "Cybersecurity Strategy"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Dark Reading", url: "https://darkreading.com/cybersecurity-operations/former-citigroup-ciso-blauner-great-security-leader", lang: "EN" }
    ]
