    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "前瞻技術",
    title: "微軟發表自研資安AI模型MAI-Cyber-1-Flash，結合MDASH提升漏洞發現與修補效率",
    summary: "微軟公布了首個自研資安AI模型MAI-Cyber-1-Flash，並將其嵌入到微軟的MDASH平臺中，用於漏洞發現與修補。微軟執行長Satya Nadella說明，此模型是微軟從頭打造，專門用於在複雜程式碼庫中尋找難以發現的漏洞。結合MDASH後，該系統具備頂級效能，同時宣稱成本比使用GPT-5.4等服務低達五成。此外，微軟同步推出代理式安全系統Project Perception，讓代理人可在MDASH中處理持續監控、修補和封鎖新漏洞等多種安全工作流。微軟強調，MAI-Cyber-1-Flash經過安全導向校準和AI Red Team嚴格評估。在競爭激烈的AI安全領域，微軟持續透過自研模型（如MAI-Image-2.5-Pro、MAI-Voice-2-Flash）建立技術壁壘，並將MDASH帶入Nvidia等廠商組成的開放安全AI聯盟，提供業界標準的漏洞尋找與修補能力。",
    tags: ["微軟", "MAI-Cyber-1-Flash", "MDASH", "AI安全", "漏洞修補", "Project Perception"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Releases Proprietary Security AI Model MAI-Cyber-1-Flash, Integrating with MDASH to Enhance Vulnerability Discovery and Patching Efficiency",
    summary_en: "Microsoft has unveiled its first proprietary security AI model, MAI-Cyber-1-Flash, and embedded it into Microsoft's MDASH platform for vulnerability discovery and patching. Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella stated that this model was built from scratch by Microsoft, specifically designed to find difficult-to-detect vulnerabilities within complex codebases. Combined with MDASH, the system boasts top-tier performance while claiming a cost reduction of up to 50% compared to services like GPT-5.4. Furthermore, Microsoft simultaneously launched the proxy security system, Project Perception, enabling proxies to handle various security workflows within MDASH, such as continuous monitoring, patching, and blocking of new vulnerabilities. Microsoft emphasized that MAI-Cyber-1-Flash underwent safety-oriented calibration and rigorous evaluation by an AI Red Team. In the highly competitive AI security domain, Microsoft continues to build technical moats through proprietary models (such as MAI-Image-2.5-Pro and MAI-Voice-2-Flash) and is bringing MDASH into an open security AI alliance formed with vendors like Nvidia, offering industry-standard vulnerability discovery and patching capabilities.",
    tags_en: ["Microsoft", "MAI-Cyber-1-Flash", "MDASH", "AI Security", "Vulnerability Patching", "Project Perception"],
