    title: "三星持續推廣磁吸配件，儘管Galaxy手機型號（如Z Fold 8）尚未內建Qi2磁鐵標準",
    summary: "本文指出，儘管三星最新的Galaxy手機型號，包括Galaxy Z Fold 8系列，仍未內建Qi2磁鐵標準，但公司持續積極推出各種磁吸配件，以推動市場接受度。Qi2標準本質上類似Apple的MagSafe，旨在提供更廣泛的磁吸陣列應用。三星目前傾向利用「Qi2 Ready」計畫，讓設備製造商將磁鐵功能外包至保護殼，以輔助手機與充電器或配件的對齊。儘管如此，三星仍推出如「Dual Magnet Holder Slim」和「360 Stand Magnet」等昂貴的磁吸配件，這些配件需要用戶搭配手機殼才能發揮作用，單獨使用無法與Galaxy手機結合。這顯示三星高度重視磁吸配件的市場吸引力，但似乎仍將垂直相機佈局置於更重要的戰略位置。",
    tags: ["Samsung", "Qi2", "Galaxy Z Fold 8", "磁吸配件", "MagSafe", "供應鏈"],
    title_en: "Samsung Continues Promoting Magnetic Accessories Despite Galaxy Phone Models (e.g., Z Fold 8) Not Integrating Qi2 Magnet Standard",
    summary_en: "The article points out that although Samsung's latest Galaxy phone models, including the Galaxy Z Fold 8 series, have not yet integrated the Qi2 magnetic standard, the company continues to actively launch various magnetic accessories to drive market adoption. The Qi2 standard is essentially similar to Apple's MagSafe and aims to provide a more widespread magnetic array application. Samsung currently favors utilizing the 'Qi2 Ready' program, allowing device manufacturers to outsource the magnetic function to protective cases to assist in the alignment of the phone with chargers or accessories. Nevertheless, Samsung continues to release expensive magnetic accessories such as the 'Dual Magnet Holder Slim' and '360 Stand Magnet.' These accessories require users to pair them with a phone case to function and cannot connect to a Galaxy phone when used alone. This indicates that Samsung highly values the market appeal of magnetic accessories, but appears to place the vertical camera layout in a more critical strategic position.",
