    title: "iyO 提告 OpenAI 與 Jony Ive 侵權案：法院批准暫停和解談判，爭議焦點仍圍繞品牌商標權",
    summary: "資安新聞編輯根據法院文件，報導了關於 iyO 針對 OpenAI 和 Jony Ive 提起的商標侵權訴訟的最新進展。原訴訟起因於 OpenAI 宣布收購 Jony Ive 的 io Products 成立新一代 AI 設備，iyO 隨即提出侵權訴訟，後又追加了商業秘密的指控。雙方已向法院提交聯合通知，表示已在原則上達成和解，並請求法院暫停七天，以完成最終協議細節。法院已批准此暫停，並設定了新的時間表：雙方須在 8/6/26 前提交要求駁回訴訟或聯合狀態報告。原定於 7/28/2026 的聽證會已被取消並改期至 9/8/2026。此案的爭議核心在於「io」品牌商標的歸屬權，以及 OpenAI 過去曾承諾不使用該品牌名稱的相關約束力。本案的發展顯示，即使在商業和技術領域，品牌商標的法律爭議依然高度複雜，需持續關注和解的具體條款。",
    tags: ["iyO", "OpenAI", "Jony Ive", "商標權", "法律訴訟", "AI 設備", "品牌爭議"],
    title_en: "iyO Files Copyright Infringement Lawsuit Against OpenAI and Jony Ive: Court Approves Stay on Settlement Talks, Focus Remains on Brand Trademark Rights",
    summary_en: "According to court documents reported by a cybersecurity news editor, this covers the latest developments in the trademark infringement lawsuit filed by iyO against OpenAI and Jony Ive. The original lawsuit stemmed from OpenAI's announcement of acquiring Jony Ive's io Products to launch a new generation of AI devices. iyO subsequently filed the infringement lawsuit and later added charges of trade secret misappropriation. Both parties have submitted a joint notice to the court, stating that they have reached a settlement in principle and requesting a seven-day stay to finalize the detailed agreement. The court has approved this stay and set a new timeline: both parties must submit a request to dismiss the lawsuit or a joint status report by 8/6/26. The hearing originally scheduled for 7/28/2026 has been canceled and rescheduled to 9/8/2026. The core dispute in this case revolves around the ownership of the \"io\" brand trademark and the binding nature of OpenAI's past commitment not to use this brand name. The development of this case shows that even in the commercial and technical spheres, brand trademark disputes remain highly complex, requiring continued attention to the specific terms of the settlement.",
