    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Apple 執行長 John Ternus 證實 Apple TV 串流服務將持續發展，維持娛樂業務動能",
    summary: "Apple 新任執行長 John Ternus 在接受路透社採訪時表示，公司計劃持續推動 Apple TV 串流服務，並致力於在娛樂業務上建立新的動能。Ternus 認為 Apple TV 目前擁有巨大的發展勢頭，並預計將持續利用內容的豐富性來擴大服務。前任執行長 Tim Cook 也對此表示支持，並提到 F1 電影的成功，暗示未來將有更多類似的內容。此外，Apple 服務負責人 Eddy Cue 也透露，Apple TV 的內容將會持續優化和增加。這顯示 Apple 將持續將內容和娛樂服務視為重要的成長支柱，而非削減的項目。目前文章未提及任何技術漏洞或安全風險，僅為業務策略更新。",
    tags: ["Apple", "Apple TV", "John Ternus", "串流媒體", "娛樂業務", "Apple Services"],
    title_en: "Apple CEO John Ternus confirms continued development of Apple TV streaming service, maintaining momentum in entertainment business",
    summary_en: "In an interview with Reuters, Apple's new CEO John Ternus stated that the company plans to continue promoting the Apple TV streaming service and is committed to building new momentum in the entertainment business. Ternus believes Apple TV currently has significant growth potential and expects to continue expanding the service by leveraging content richness. Former CEO Tim Cook also expressed support for this, mentioning the success of the F1 movie, suggesting more similar content in the future. Furthermore, Apple Services head Eddy Cue revealed that Apple TV's content will continue to be optimized and increased. This indicates that Apple will continue to view content and entertainment services as important growth pillars, rather than areas for reduction. The article currently does not mention any technical vulnerabilities or security risks; it is solely a business strategy update.",
